'''Perry Duche''' (ペリ艦長, ''Peri Kanchō'', '''Captain Peri''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Duche]] introduced in the [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year|12th and 1/2 Anniversary]] stages. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Perry Duche
|image = E 721.png
|first appearance = [[The Commodore Demands a Decision (Normal)]]
|money drop = 800¢ - 3,160¢
}}

==Enemy==
Duche turned into a perrycan! His new appearance nerfs him significantly and no longer has multi-hit, but he gains an [[Omni Strike]] which allows him to generate consistent, deadly [[Explosion]]s hitting up to 525 range away.

==Strategy==
This enemy has low base stats, but is often buffed beyond belief in some stages, with his Explosions and Omni Strikes greatly expanding his reach, forcing players to tackle him at range when brute force alone fails.

