==Trivia==
*Perry Duche's name and design reference [[wikipedia:Matthew C. Perry|Matthew Perry]] (ペリー ''Perī''), who is known for the [[wikipedia:Perry Expedition|Perry Expedition]] that ended Japan's isolationism in the [[wikipedia:Edo period|Edo period]].
**Perry Duche's Japanese name, Peri Kanchō, is a pun on ''Perry'', ペリカン ''perikan'' (pelican) and 艦長 ''kanchō'' (captain).
*Since the [[Road to Unification]] event is based on the [[wikipedia:Sengoku period|Sengoku period]] of Japan, Perry Duche may have been designed to be countered by the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] units, all of whom are [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]].
*Perry Duche is the only enemy from the [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year|12th and 1/2 Anniversary]] event to have no description.

